    },
    {
      "body": "Hi @BBuf @DarkSharpness @HaiShaw @celve @HydraQYH @yuan-luo , could you take a look as a codeowner of `python/sglang/kernels`?\r\nThis is a one-line change in `softmax_temp_flashinfer` (clamp FlashInfer softmax\r\noutput to <= 1.0). It's already approved by @Qiaolin-Yu (spec decoding oncall).\r\nDetails in #45517. Thanks!\r\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-27T09:28:00Z",
